 ttps://itcoder.co.za/lesson.php?c=pascal&id=lesson27\n- Pascal 8 (part): De
 cisions / Branching\n    focus: complex Boolean expressions and truth table
 s with 4 variables\n    https://itcoder.co.za/lesson.php?c=pascal&id=lesson
