 der.co.za/lesson.php?c=sql&id=dbkeys\n- SQL 4: A good design\n    focus: re
 dundancy\, repeating groups\, duplicate and derived data\, atomic and non-a
 tomic fields\; update\, insert and delete anomalies\n    https://itcoder.co
 .za/lesson.php?c=sql&id=dbdesign
